<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>路口管理老师</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>路口</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>：群贤中路与绿云路红绿灯交叉点</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  <FONT color=#ff0000>周国才</FONT> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>沈超华</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>路口</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">2</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>：解放路与梅南路红绿灯路口左转</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  <FONT color=#ff0000>王海燕</FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>说明：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">1. </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>各班随队老师由班主任安排具体任务；</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">2. </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>请各路口管理老师按照要求提前</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">10</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>分钟左右到达指定地点，引导学生顺利通过；</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>三、纪律要求及注意事项</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">1.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>活动前，班主任要做好安全教育和调查工作，体质特殊和身体不佳的学生，不宜参加。参加和不参加的学生都要填写好“申请书”（“申请书”由班主任保存）。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">2.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>出发前以及返回学校，班主任都要组织专人清点人数；班主任活动中要随带家长联系电话，保证紧急情况下的即时联系。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">3.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>在步行过程中，各班务必保持两路纵队，女生在前、男生在后。学生必须严守纪律，不得相互超越，不得追逐打闹，不得私自离队，不得带手机，中途不得停留，严禁沿途丢扔垃圾。要做到一切行动听指挥，严格遵守集合时间。自备矿泉水。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">4.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>在景区自由活动时，注意安全，按时到达集合地点，整队步行返校。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">5. </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>每位学生穿校服，佩戴徽章，准备好运动鞋。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">6. </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>途中师生因身体原因不能坚持行走的，经班主任同意可由随队校车实施救护。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">7. </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>整个活动的组织情况由德育处负责评价，评价结果作为大型活动组织奖的考核依据</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">8.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>请假的学生务必在教室自修，请假名单请班主任提前交给年段长，不得提前离校。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: right; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=right><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>德育处</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: right; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=right><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                      </SPAN>2018</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">11</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">12</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>日</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
